<!-- SECTION 7: 7-STEP PROCESS -->
<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">6-Step Process for Tender Turnover Certificate in Pune</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Pune tenders: mahatenders.gov.in (PMC/PCMC/PWD/MSEDCL). Central: eprocure.gov.in. GEM: gem.gov.in. Railways: ireps.gov.in. UDIN: udin.icai.org. Patron coordinates from Wagholi office.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Read NIT and Identify Exact Requirement</h3><p class="step-description">The most critical step. Find turnover requirement under 'Eligibility Criteria' or 'PQR.' Identify: (a) number of FYs, (b) turnover type (total/average/similar works/combination), (c) minimum threshold, (d) prescribed format/annexure, (e) specific declarations. For PMC: Maharashtra PWD Manual format. For GEM: bid document online. Patron reviews every NIT before preparing.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>NIT requirement identified</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Format confirmed</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><line x1="30" y1="22" x2="85" y2="22" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="30" y1="35" x2="78" y2="35" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3"/><circle cx="85" cy="55" r="8" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M81 55l3 3 5-5" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">NIT Read</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Collect Financial Documents</h3><p class="step-description">Audited financials, ITR (with computation + P&amp;L), GST returns (GSTR-1/3B/9), bank statements, PAN, GSTIN, CIN. For similar works: work orders, completion certificates, project-wise P&amp;L. For JV bids: each partner provides own documents. Patron provides NIT-specific checklist.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Financials collected</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Work orders ready</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Documents</text><rect x="25" y="30" width="70" height="18" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1"/><text x="60" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">ITR + GST + Work Orders</text><text x="60" y="62" font-size="5" fill="#25D366" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Data Complete</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Collected</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">CA Verifies with Three-Way Reconciliation</h3><p class="step-description">P&amp;L turnover vs ITR declared vs GST GSTR-1 outward supply. Differences from timing, credit notes, export exchange rates reconciled and documented. For similar works: project-wise revenue verified against work orders and client confirmations. Committee may independently verify against government databases.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Three-way reconciled</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Similar works verified</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">3-Way Reconciliation</text><rect x="25" y="30" width="70" height="18" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><text x="60" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">P&amp;L vs ITR vs GST</text><text x="60" y="62" font-size="5" fill="#F5A623" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Turnover Verified</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Reconciled</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">Prepare Certificate in NIT-Prescribed Format</h3><p class="step-description">Entity details, nature of business, FY(s), annual turnover (tabular), average annual (per NIT formula), similar works (with project list if required), cross-references to PAN/GSTIN, all NIT-mandated declarations (no blacklisting, no litigation, no default). If NIT provides annexure template, CA fills that exact template. On CA official letterhead.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>NIT format matched</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Declarations included</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">NIT Format</text><rect x="25" y="30" width="70" height="18" rx="3" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1"/><text x="60" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Annexure Compliant</text><text x="60" y="62" font-size="5" fill="#25D366" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Formatted</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Prepared</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5</span><h3 class="step-title">Draft Review and Bidder Approval</h3><p class="step-description">Verify: correct entity name (must match bid), correct turnover figures, correct PAN/GSTIN, correct FY periods, all declarations. No inflation permitted - CA certifies only verified figures. For similar works: confirm projects match NIT definition. Patron shares drafts within hours for urgent, 24 hours standard.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Bidder approved</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>NIT requirements verified</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="25" y="15" width="70" height="10" rx="3" fill="#25D366" opacity="0.15"/><text x="60" y="23" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Draft Approved</text><text x="60" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Bid-Name Matched</text><text x="60" y="58" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Ready for UDIN</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Approved</span><span class="step-number-large">05</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 6</span><h3 class="step-title">UDIN Generation and e-Tender Upload</h3><p class="step-description">CA finalizes, generates UDIN via ICAI portal, signs with stamp, seal, membership number. Digital scan (PDF) immediately for e-tender upload (mahatenders.gov.in / eprocure.gov.in / gem.gov.in / ireps.gov.in). Physical hardcopy for evaluation committee verification. Keep original - many Pune authorities request it before awarding.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>UDIN certified</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Uploaded to e-tender</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-weight="800" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">UDIN + Upload</text><rect x="25" y="30" width="70" height="15" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="1"/><text x="60" y="40" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">e-Tender Portal Ready</text><text x="60" y="62" font-size="5" fill="#25D366" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Bid Submitted</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Uploaded</span><span class="step-number-large">06</span></div></div></div>


